{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Badminton</strong> brings the speed, precision, and energy of real-world badminton to life. Experience the fastest racket sport in the world like never before, in a realistic and accessible game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udff8 REALISTIC GAMEPLAY &amp; PHYSICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic shuttle physics</strong> and <strong>realistic</strong>\u00a0<strong>player animations</strong> recreate the flow and intensity of real matches.\u00a0Expect a challenge that feels natural, with performance shaped by positioning, timing, and shot selection.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 CAREER MODE: BUILD YOUR JOURNEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from the bottom and rise through a full career mode, competing in the <strong>world's biggest tournaments</strong>. <strong>Train, improve, and climb a ranking</strong> system inspired by real-world competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your playstyle naturally: your skills evolve based on how you train and compete.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc65 LOCAL MULTIPLAYER (UP TO 4 PLAYERS)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play singles or doubles with your friends.\u00a0Pure Badminton supports local <strong>multiplayer</strong> for <strong>up to 4 players</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whether you're a competitive player or a lifelong fan, it\u2019s time to bring your skills to the digital court.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ready to play","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591310/fc17f82e6fd032881bdca4514163f44206546d16.jpg"},{"name":"First victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591310/3aa4a2b6f43e282a6fd8cbe76d3de3da0de51429.jpg"},{"name":"First tournament","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591310/3a178c6e1c0b712e7fc2bcf1a1489